OL,3,GNEWSAMan guilty of manslaughter after
OL,4,Astreet attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been found guilty of killing
OL,7,Fanother man who was found injured and
OL,8,Funconscious on a pavement after the
OL,9,Fattack.
OL,11,FMichael Bennett, 38, died in hospital
OL,12,Ftwo weeks after being discovered in
OL,13,FReservoir Road, Erdington, Birmingham,
OL,14,Fat about 01:00 BST on 27 March.
OL,16,FFollowing a trial at Birmingham Crown
OL,17,FCourt, a jury cleared Kevin Siviter,
OL,18,F42, of murder but found him guilty of
OL,19,Fmanslaughter by a majority of 10 to
OL,20,Ftwo.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
