OL,4,Astreet attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FSiviter, of Newcombe Road, Handsworth,
OL,7,Fwas remanded into custody at the court
OL,8,Fon Tuesday until 18 January, when he is
OL,9,Fdue to be sentenced.
